220		\leanok
221		\uses{thm:main-formal}
222		Under exactly the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:main-formal}, the same two
223		projective polynomial measurements satisfy all three conclusions with the
224		explicit error
225		\[
226			\nu_{\mathrm{base}}=
227			100000 k^2m^4\left(
228				\eps^{1/40000}+(d/q)^{1/40000}
229				+e^{-k/(2560000m^2)}\right).
230		\]
